<title>USA: Compaq plans $60 mln ad campaign.</title>
<headline>Compaq plans $60 mln ad campaign.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compaq Computer Corp said on Monday it would launch a $60 million advertising campaign to run through the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>It said the campaign is the first part of a broader marketing strategy that will continue through next year, &quot;encompassing the company's marketing programs and strategies at all levels.&quot;</p>
</text>
